%% Notifications & Communications Engine (Phase 8, ADR 0037)
flowchart TD
    BM[Business module] -->|same tx, commit| OB[(outbox_events)]
    OB -->|poll: app.outbox_dispatcher GUC<br/>cross-tenant SELECT + dispatched_at only| DISP[OutboxDispatcher]
    DISP -->|withTenantSystemContext<br/>tenant from the event row| ENG[NotificationEngine]

    subgraph ENG_INTERNALS [per event, per tenant RLS context]
      RULES[Effective rules<br/>code defaults ⊕ tenant overrides]
      CTX[Safe context builder<br/>whitelisted business fields only]
      RR[RecipientResolver<br/>USER · ACTOR · ASSIGNED_USER · ROLE · CUSTOMER]
      TR["Template render<br/>{{ var }} interpolation only"]
    end
    ENG --> RULES --> CTX --> RR --> TR
    TR -->|INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING| N[(notifications)]
    TR -->|dedupe + idempotency keys| D[(notification_deliveries · PENDING)]
    D -->|jobId = deliveryId| Q[[BullMQ notifications queue]]

    Q -->|deliver job · attempts + backoff| DEL[NotificationDeliveryService]
    DEL --> PREF{Preference gate<br/>unless rule non-suppressible}
    PREF -->|blocked| CANCEL[status = CANCELLED]
    PREF -->|allowed| ADPT{ChannelAdapter}
    ADPT --> INAPP[in-app · the notifications row]
    ADPT --> EMAIL[email · EmailProvider<br/>fake / console / smtp]
    ADPT --> WA[whatsapp · interface only]
    ADPT --> SMS[sms · interface only]
    INAPP --> SENT[status = SENT]
    EMAIL -->|ok| SENT
    EMAIL -->|transient| RETRY[re-throw → BullMQ retry] --> Q
    EMAIL -->|permanent / attempts exhausted| FAIL[status = FAILED]

    N -->|GET /notifications, bell| UI[Web app shell + /settings/notifications]
    D -->|GET /admin/notifications/deliveries| ADMIN[/admin/notifications*/]
